{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>In the thickness of the cloud.</b> In the thickness of the cloud — and that is עֲרָפֶל." "<b>And also in you.</b> Also in the prophets who come after you (Mekhilta)." "<b>And Moses told the words, etc.</b> On the morrow — which is the fourth of the month." "<b>The words of the people, etc.</b> A response concerning this matter: 'I have heard from them that their wish is to hear from you; one who hears from the mouth of an envoy is not like one who hears from the mouth of the king — our wish is to see our king' (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:06.590112265Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}